Notice for the Xing4.0 MLX model port (src/mlx2/runtime/models/xing4_0.py).

1. MLA attention, MultiLinear/QuantizedMultiLinear, the absorbed-path gate,
   the noaux_tc MoE block and the expert-stacking / kv_b_proj folding
   sanitize logic are adapted from mlx-lm-unified
   (mlx_lm/models/deepseek_v3.py and mlx_lm/models/mla.py, revision
   13eb83388750435bcc751d0b9e33857a38152544).

