2. The mHC (Manifold-constrained Hyper-Connections) math, router
   semantics, stream expansion/contraction and decoder-layer wiring are a
   re-implementation in MLX of the Xing4.0-29B-A4B Hugging Face reference
   modeling code (modeling_xing4_0.py / configuration_xing4_0.py, Copyright
   China Telecom Artificial Intelligence Technology Co., Ltd., distributed
   under the Apache License, Version 2.0 per the model card). No upstream
   source text is copied into this repository; the reference files are only
   imported (from an out-of-tree directory) by
   scripts/xing4_0_reference_fixture.py to generate test fixtures.

