   distributed under the License is distributed on an "AS IS" BASIS,
   WITHOUT WARRANTIES OR CONDITIONS OF ANY KIND, either express or implied.
   Modifications: translated from PyTorch to MLX; fp32 mHC projection and
   stream update; optional compiled mHC spans; latent KV cache; MTP head
   added from the DeepSeek-V3 MTP definition (the HF reference ignores it).
